  "changelog": "1688-shop-health-check 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release of the 1688 \u5e97\u94fa\u5065\u5eb7\u5206\u6790 skill.\n- Provides a two-stage, interactive health analysis for 1688 shops across six key dimensions: overall metrics, abnormal products, star products, activity effectiveness, customer geography, and top customer retention.\n- Outputs begin with an overall shop health assessment and prompt users to select in-depth analysis directions.\n- Each deep-dive follows a strict output format: concise summary, visual JSON report, and actionable cards (for abnormal product analysis).\n- All visualization and interaction formats are rigorously standardized for professional, actionable business diagnostics.",
